      "record": {
        "id": "a-creation-session-outlives-its-last-step",
        "statement": "Creation limits are usable only when the retention outlasts the session timeout plus the longest step that can start just before it: the call timeout, ten seconds of slack and sixty seconds to revoke the key, search ahead and settle; otherwise a session row could be deleted before its last step's spend is charged.",
